Account qualification model
The named organizations should be scored before appearing as an actionable sales list.

Qualification dimensions
Dimension	Qualification question	Weight
Neural-data capacity	Does the workload require at least 250 GB of reusable vectors, features, document representations, or model artifacts?	20%
Data reuse	Are the same representations accessed repeatedly rather than processed only once?	15%
Locality or sovereignty	Must data remain on-premises, regional, disconnected, or under customer control?	15%
Priced bottleneck	Can the customer identify a GPU, DRAM, cloud, network, or labor cost to remove?	20%
Latency fit	Can the service tolerate ATMOS’s measured p95/p99 without harming the workflow?	10%
Operator fit	Can qualified ATMOS kernels execute the required gather, scoring, rerank, top-k or extraction operations?	10%
Budget and timing	Is an expansion, refresh, cloud renewal, or operational initiative funded within 12–24 months?	10%
